{"id":"60906c78f1c2c236","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zfc-measure8-projective-limit-measure.md","title":"ZFC Measure8 Projective Limit Measure","display":"df-zfc-measure8-projective-limit-measure — ZFC Measure8 Projective Limit Measure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure8-projective-limit-measure","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure8-projective-limit-measure"],"display":"df-zfc-measure8-projective-limit-measure — ZFC Measure8 Projective Limit Measure","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-directed-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure8-projective-limit-measure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure8-projective-limit-measure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure8-projective-limit-measure — ZFC Measure8 Projective Limit Measure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e61c089fc5e610a6\" href=\"?note=e61c089fc5e610a6\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-directed-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-directed-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,\\preceq,\\vec X,\\vec{\\mathcal F},\\vec\\mu,\\Pi,X,\\mathcal F,\\vec\\pi,\\mu\\in V\">\\(I,\\preceq,\\vec X,\\vec{\\mathcal F},\\vec\\mu,\\Pi,X,\\mathcal F,\\vec\\pi,\\mu\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Directed}_S,\\mathrm{Measure}_S,\\mathrm{Function}:V^2\\cup V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Directed}_S,\\mathrm{Measure}_S,\\mathrm{Function}:V^2\\cup V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_X\">\\(\\sigma_X\\)</span> (generated sigma-algebra operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8ProjectiveLimitMeasure}_S:V^{10}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8ProjectiveLimitMeasure}_S:V^{10}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure8\\text{-}projective\\text{-}limit\\text{-}measure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8ProjectiveLimitMeasure}_S(I,\\preceq,\\vec X,\\vec{\\mathcal F},\\vec\\mu,\\Pi,X,\\mathcal F,\\vec\\pi,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Directed}_S(I,\\preceq)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec X))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec{\\mathcal F},I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec{\\mathcal F}))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\mu,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\mu))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\vec\\mu(i),\\vec X(i),\\vec{\\mathcal F}(i))\\land\\vec\\mu(i)(\\vec X(i))=1\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(\\Pi,\\{\\langle j,i\\rangle\\in I^2:i\\preceq j\\},\\operatorname{ran}(\\Pi)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\Bigl(i\\preceq j\\to\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\Pi(\\langle j,i\\rangle),\\vec X(j),\\vec X(i))\n\\land\\forall A\\in\\vec{\\mathcal F}(i)\\;\\bigl(\n\\Pi(\\langle j,i\\rangle)^{-1}[A]\\in\\vec{\\mathcal F}(j)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{64mm}\\land\\vec\\mu(j)(\\Pi(\\langle j,i\\rangle)^{-1}[A])=\\vec\\mu(i)(A)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\forall x\\in\\vec X(i)\\;(\\Pi(\\langle i,i\\rangle)(x)=x)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i,j,k\\in I\\;\\Bigl(i\\preceq j\\land j\\preceq k\\to\n\\Pi(\\langle k,i\\rangle)=\\Pi(\\langle j,i\\rangle)\\circ\\Pi(\\langle k,j\\rangle)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land X=\\left\\{x\\in\\prod_{i\\in I}\\vec X(i):\\forall i,j\\in I\\;(i\\preceq j\\to\\Pi(\\langle j,i\\rangle)(x(j))=x(i))\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\pi,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\pi))\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\pi(i),X,\\vec X(i))\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\vec\\pi(i)(x)=x(i))\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathcal F=\\sigma_X\\!\\left(\\{\\vec\\pi(i)^{-1}[A]:i\\in I\\land A\\in\\vec{\\mathcal F}(i)\\}\\right)\n\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\land\\mu(X)=1\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\forall A\\in\\vec{\\mathcal F}(i)\\;\\left(\n\\vec\\pi(i)^{-1}[A]\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mu(\\vec\\pi(i)^{-1}[A])=\\vec\\mu(i)(A)\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure8\\text{-}projective\\text{-}limit\\text{-}measure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8ProjectiveLimitMeasure}_S(I,\\preceq,\\vec X,\\vec{\\mathcal F},\\vec\\mu,\\Pi,X,\\mathcal F,\\vec\\pi,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Directed}_S(I,\\preceq)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec X))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec{\\mathcal F},I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec{\\mathcal F}))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\mu,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\mu))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\vec\\mu(i),\\vec X(i),\\vec{\\mathcal F}(i))\\land\\vec\\mu(i)(\\vec X(i))=1\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(\\Pi,\\{\\langle j,i\\rangle\\in I^2:i\\preceq j\\},\\operatorname{ran}(\\Pi)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\Bigl(i\\preceq j\\to\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\Pi(\\langle j,i\\rangle),\\vec X(j),\\vec X(i))\n\\land\\forall A\\in\\vec{\\mathcal F}(i)\\;\\bigl(\n\\Pi(\\langle j,i\\rangle)^{-1}[A]\\in\\vec{\\mathcal F}(j)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{64mm}\\land\\vec\\mu(j)(\\Pi(\\langle j,i\\rangle)^{-1}[A])=\\vec\\mu(i)(A)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\forall x\\in\\vec X(i)\\;(\\Pi(\\langle i,i\\rangle)(x)=x)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i,j,k\\in I\\;\\Bigl(i\\preceq j\\land j\\preceq k\\to\n\\Pi(\\langle k,i\\rangle)=\\Pi(\\langle j,i\\rangle)\\circ\\Pi(\\langle k,j\\rangle)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land X=\\left\\{x\\in\\prod_{i\\in I}\\vec X(i):\\forall i,j\\in I\\;(i\\preceq j\\to\\Pi(\\langle j,i\\rangle)(x(j))=x(i))\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\pi,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\pi))\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\pi(i),X,\\vec X(i))\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\vec\\pi(i)(x)=x(i))\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathcal F=\\sigma_X\\!\\left(\\{\\vec\\pi(i)^{-1}[A]:i\\in I\\land A\\in\\vec{\\mathcal F}(i)\\}\\right)\n\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\land\\mu(X)=1\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\forall A\\in\\vec{\\mathcal F}(i)\\;\\left(\n\\vec\\pi(i)^{-1}[A]\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mu(\\vec\\pi(i)^{-1}[A])=\\vec\\mu(i)(A)\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The bonding maps form a coherent projective system, preserve the coordinate measures by explicit measurable-preimage equations, and the limit measure has the prescribed coordinate marginals.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-directed-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"e61c089fc5e610a6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-directed-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\sigma_X$ (generated sigma-algebra operator, see [[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I,\\preceq,\\vec X,\\vec{\\mathcal F},\\vec\\mu,\\Pi,X,\\mathcal F,\\vec\\pi,\\mu\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Directed}_S,\\mathrm{Measure}_S,\\mathrm{Function}:V^2\\cup V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma_X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8ProjectiveLimitMeasure}_S:V^{10}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"t